#. Tag: title
#: details-accounts.docbook:13
#, no-c-format
msgid "Accounts"
msgstr "Računi"

#. Tag: title
#: details-accounts.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Accounts View"
msgstr "Pregled ačuna"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:18
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The Accounts View provides a summary of all the accounts. There are four "
#| "different account categories: Asset, Liability, Income, and Expense. "
#| "Typical asset accounts include bank accounts, cash, and investments, "
#| "while typical liability accounts include credit cards and loans."
msgid ""
"The Accounts view provides a summary of all the accounts. It is similar to "
"the Institutions view, except accounts are grouped under the Asset and "
"Liability asset categories. Typical asset accounts include bank accounts, "
"cash, and investments, while typical liability accounts include credit cards "
"and loans."
msgstr ""
"Pregled  računa(Accounts View) obezbijeđuje listu svih računa. Postoje "
"četiri različite kategorije računa: imovinski(Asset), "
"obavezujući(Liability), prihodni(Income) i rashodni(Expense). Tipični "
"prihodni računi uključuju bankovne račune, novac i investicije, dok "
"obavezujući računi uključuju kreditne kartice i kredite."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are actually two other account categories: Income and Expense. "
"Categories are a way to organize your transaction; they are grouped under "
"either the Income or Expense account category and are treated internally by "
"&kmymoney; as accounts. They are described in more detail in the chapter on "
"<link linkend=\"details.categories\">Categories</link>. The Income and "
"Expense account categories are always displayed in the Categories view, but "
"it is possible to <link linkend=\"details.settings\">configure &kmymoney;</"
"link> to also display them on the Accounts view."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: details-accounts.docbook:38
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "<screeninfo>Parent Account</screeninfo>"
msgid "<screeninfo>account view</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Nadređeni račun</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-accounts.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>account view</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Similar to the Institutions view, the Accounts view displays several columns "
"with descriptive and summary information about each account. The rest of "
"this chapter will focus on Asset and Liability account functionality. Income "
"and Expense accounts, &ie;, Categories, are described in the chapter on "
"<link linkend=\"details.categories\">Categories</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: details-accounts.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating an Account"
msgstr "Stvaranje računa"

#. Tag: emphasis
#: details-accounts.docbook:64
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "NOTE: You must have a file open before you can create a new account. If "
#| "you do not have an existing file, you will need to create a <link linkend="
#| "\"firsttime.3\">new file</link>."
msgid ""
"NOTE: You must have a file open before you can create a new account. If you "
"do not have an existing file, you will need to <link linkend="
"\"firsttime.3\">create one</link>."
msgstr ""
"OPASKA: Morate imati otvorenu datoteku kako biste mogli kreirati novi račun. "
"Ukoliko nemate otvorenu datoteku, moracete napraviti <link linkend="
"\"firsttime.3\">novu datoteku</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:71
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "To create a new account, you can either select "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>Account</guimenu><guimenuitem>New account...</"
#| "guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the menu or choose the "
#| "<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"newacct.png"
#| "\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject><textobject> <phrase>New</phrase></"
#| "textobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> icon from the toolbar."
msgid ""
"To create a new account, you can either select <menuchoice><guimenu>Account</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>New account...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the menu "
"or choose the New account... icon "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"newacct.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject><textobject> <phrase>New</phrase></"
"textobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> from the toolbar. You can also "
"create an account from the Accounts view; click on the Accounts icon in the "
"view selector and then right click on the Asset or Liability tree icon and "
"select <guimenuitem>New account...</guimenuitem> from the popup menu."
msgstr ""
"Da biste napravili novi račun, možete odabrati ili "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Account</guimenu><guimenuitem>New account...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> iz menija ili "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"newacct.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject><textobject> <phrase>New</phrase></"
"textobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> ikonu iz toolbar-a."

#. Tag: title
#: details-accounts.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Institution (Bank) name"
msgstr "Ime institucije(banke)"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-accounts.docbook:94 details-accounts.docbook:133
#: details-accounts.docbook:280 details-accounts.docbook:318
#: details-accounts.docbook:350 details-accounts.docbook:409
#: details-accounts.docbook:509 details-accounts.docbook:534
#: details-accounts.docbook:563 details-accounts.docbook:607
#: details-accounts.docbook:643
#, no-c-format
msgid "Account Wizard"
msgstr "Čarobnjak naloga"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first step involves selecting an institution for the account. If this is "
"an account for an institution you have already created, you can select the "
"institution from the dropdown list. If you want to create a new institution, "
"click on the <guibutton>New Institution</guibutton> button. This will bring "
"up the New Institution Dialog, as described in the previous section. If this "
"is not a bank account, or if you do not want to use online banking, you do "
"not need to specify an institution."
msgstr ""
"Prvi korak uključuje odabir institucije za račun. Ukoliko je račun vezan za "
"insituciju koju ste već kreirali, možete je izabrati iz opadajuće liste. "
"Ukoliko želite da napravite novu instituciju, kliknite na <guibutton>New "
"Institution</guibutton> dugme. Ovo će otvoriti New Institution dijalog, kao "
"što je prethodno opisano. Ukoliko ne želite da napravite bankovni račun ili "
"ukoliko ne želite da koristite online bankarstvo, onda ne morate "
"specificirati instituciju."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:110
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The Account Number and the <acronym><ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/"
#| "wiki/International_Bank_Account_Number\">IBAN (International Bank Account "
#| "Number)</ulink></acronym> are not currently used by &kappname;. These "
#| "fields may be left blank and filled in at a later time; they are only "
#| "required for online banking."
msgid ""
"The Account Number and the <ulink url=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"International_Bank_Account_Number\"><acronym>IBAN</acronym> (International "
"Bank Account Number)</ulink> are not currently used by &kmymoney;. These "
"fields may be left blank and filled in at a later time; they are only "
"required for online banking."
msgstr ""
"Account Number(broj računa) i <acronym><ulink url=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/International_Bank_Account_Number\">IBAN (International Bank Account "
"Number)</ulink></acronym> se trenutno ne koriste u &kappname;. Ova polja se "
"mogu ostaviti neispunjenim i mogu se popuniti kasnije; budući da su potrebni "
"samo za online bankarstvo."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:118 details-accounts.docbook:258
#, no-c-format
msgid "To proceed to the next step click on <guibutton>Next</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"Da biste nastavili sa sljedećim korakom, kliknite na <guibutton>Next</"
"guibutton>."

#. Tag: title
#: details-accounts.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid "Account"
msgstr "Račun"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"First, enter a name for the account. This name will be used to identify it."
msgstr "Prvo unesite ime računa. Ovo ime će se koristiti za identifikaciju."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Next, select the type of account from one of the types available from the "
"dropdown list. Different account types are handled differently within "
"&kmymoney;, so it is important to choose the correct type when creating the "
"account. Also, different types of accounts require different setup "
"information, and may display different pages in the new account setup wizard "
"to collect that information."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: details-accounts.docbook:154
#, no-c-format
msgid "Checking"
msgstr "Provjeravam"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A normal checking account, the type you get with any bank or credit union."
msgstr "Uobičajeni tekući račun, kakav dobijate i u banci."

#. Tag: term
#: details-accounts.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid "Savings"
msgstr "Usteđevina"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A normal savings account, the type you get with any bank or credit union."
msgstr "Uobičajeni štedni račun, koji također možete otvoriti u banci."

#. Tag: term
#: details-accounts.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid "Credit Card"
msgstr "Kreditna kartica"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid "An account to represent your credit card."
msgstr "Račun koji predstavlja vaša kreditnu karticu."

#. Tag: term
#: details-accounts.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cash"
msgstr "Gotovina"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:183
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A general purpose account, typically used for accounts not held at a bank, "
"such as the cash in your wallet."
msgstr ""
"Opštenamjenski račun, koji se tipično koristi kao račun koji nije otvoren u "
"banci, npr. gotovina koju nosite sa sobom."

#. Tag: term
#: details-accounts.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid "Loan"
msgstr "Zajam"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:193
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "An account to manage a loan for money either borrowed or lent. With a "
#| "Loan account &kappname; automatically calculates interest payments to "
#| "help you track the remaining principal on the loan. Loans with no "
#| "interest might use the plain Asset or Liability type below, depending on "
#| "whether the money is lent or borrowed."
msgid ""
"An account to manage a loan for money either borrowed or lent. With a Loan "
"account &kmymoney; automatically calculates interest payments to help you "
"track the remaining principal on the loan. Loans with no interest might use "
"the plain Asset or Liability type below, depending on whether the money is "
"lent or borrowed."
msgstr ""
"Račun koji predstavlja novac koji je ili posuđen od nekog ili posuđen "
"nekome. Sa Loan računom &kappname; automatski računa i plaćanje kamate kako "
"bi lakše pratili koliko vam je novca u zadaom momentu preostalo da "
"isplatite. Loan računi bez kamata se mogu napraviti i kao Asset ili "
"Liability računi spomenuti prije, u ovisnosti da li je novac posuđen nekome "
"ili posuđen od nekog."

#. Tag: term
#: details-accounts.docbook:204
#, no-c-format
msgid "Investment"
msgstr "Investicija"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:206
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "An account to manage an investment such as stocks or investment funds."
msgid ""
"An account to manage an investment such as stocks, bonds, or mutual funds."
msgstr ""
"Račun koji upravlja investicijama kao što su dionice ili investiocini "
"fondovi."

#. Tag: term
#: details-accounts.docbook:214
#, no-c-format
msgid "Asset"
msgstr "Sredstvo"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An account to manage an asset that does not fit in one of the above types."
msgstr ""
"Račun koji upravlja sredstvima koja ne pripadaju dosad navedenim tipovima "
"računa."

#. Tag: term
#: details-accounts.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid "Liability"
msgstr "Obaveza"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:226
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "An account to manage a liability such as money you borrowed or a future "
#| "expense. If interest needs to be calculated, you might be better using "
#| "the Loan type above."
msgid ""
"An account to manage a money you owe or a future expense that does not fit "
"in one of the above types. This is most commonly used for loans with no "
"interest. If interest needs to be calculated, you might be better using the "
"Loan type above."
msgstr ""
"Račun koji upravlja odgovornostima kao što su novac koji ste posudili od "
"nekoga ili neki trošak u budućnosti. Ukoliko kamate trebaju biti izračunate, "
"preporučeno je da se koristi Loan tip računa."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:236
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select the currency to be used for the account from the dropdown list."
msgstr "Izaberite valutu koja će se koristiti za račun iz opadajuće liste."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter the date the account was opened or select it from the calendar using "
"the icon to the right. You will not be able to enter any transaction with a "
"date earlier than the account opening date, but you can change this date "
"later, if necessary."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:247
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Enter the opening balance for the account. If this is an existing bank "
#| "account this information can be found on your statement. If it is a new "
#| "account, the opening balance can be left at zero."
msgid ""
"Enter the opening balance for the account. If this is an existing bank "
"account, this information can be found on your statement. If it is a new "
"account, the opening balance can be left at zero."
msgstr ""
"Unesite početno stanje računa. Ukoliko je ovo postojeći račun iz banke, ovu "
"informaciju možete naći na izvodu. Ukoliko je ovo novi račun, početno stanje "
"se može ostaviti na nuli."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:253
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Selecting the <emphasis>Preferred Account</emphasis> check box will allow "
#| "preferred access in some dialogs and views of &kappname;."
msgid ""
"Selecting the <emphasis>Preferred Account</emphasis> check box will allow "
"preferred access in some dialogs and views of &kmymoney;."
msgstr ""
"Selektirajući <emphasis>Preferirani račun</emphasis> će omogućiti željeni "
"pristup u nekim dijalozima i pregledima &kappname;."

#. Tag: title
#: details-accounts.docbook:264
#, no-c-format
msgid "Credit Card Accounts"
msgstr "Računi kreditnih kartica"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:266
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "When creating a Credit Card account, you can optionally have &kappname; "
#| "create a <link linkend=\"details.schedules\">scheduled transaction</link> "
#| "for you."
msgid ""
"When creating a Credit Card account, after entering the basic information "
"and clicking <guibutton>Next</guibutton>, you can optionally have &kmymoney; "
"create a <link linkend=\"details.schedules\">scheduled transaction</link> "
"for you."
msgstr ""
"Prilikom kreiranja računa za kreditnu karticu, opcionalno možete omogućiti "
"da &kappname; napravi <link linkend=\"details.schedules\">zakazane "
"transakcije</link> za vas."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:286
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you want such a transaction generated, make sure the tick box is "
#| "checked and enter the required information."
msgid ""
"If you want such a transaction generated, make sure the check box is "
"selected and enter the required information."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko želite da takva transakcija bude napravljena, obavezno obilježite "
"potvrdni okvir i unesite potrebne informacije."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:291
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click on <guibutton>Next</guibutton> to continue."
msgstr "Kliknite na <guibutton>Dalje</guibutton> za anstavak."

#. Tag: title
#: details-accounts.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid "Investment Accounts"
msgstr "Investicioni računi"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:299
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In &kmymoney;, Investment accounts contain only equities (stocks, bonds, "
"&etc;) but do not contain cash. (This is why you cannot specify a Opening "
"balance for an Investment account.) If a transaction in an Investment "
"account requires or generates cash (such as to buy or sell stock,) a "
"Brokerage account is used for the cash. Brokerage accounts are described "
"further in the chapter on <link linkend=\"details.investments\">Investments</"
"link>. When you create a new Investment account, after entering the basic "
"information, and clicking <guibutton>Next</guibutton>, you have the option "
"to create an associated Brokerage account."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:324
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is generally best to create the Brokerage account here, which will be "
"given the same name as the Investment account, with \"(Brokerage)\" "
"appended. Currently it is not possible to specify the opening date or "
"balance for the Brokerage account at this point; you may do by editing the "
"account details after the account has been created."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: details-accounts.docbook:334
#, no-c-format
msgid "Loan Accounts"
msgstr "Računi zajmova"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:336
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Loan accounts are special accounts used to help you manage Loans with "
#| "interest and scheduled repayments. By providing &kappname; with "
#| "information about the loan, &kappname; can help you track interest "
#| "payments and the remaining principal of the loan."
msgid ""
"Loan accounts are special accounts used to help you manage Loans with "
"interest and scheduled repayments. By providing &kmymoney; with information "
"about the loan, &kmymoney; can help you track interest payments and the "
"remaining principal of the loan."
msgstr ""
"Računi zajmova su posebni računi koji vam pomažu da upravljate zajmovima sa "
"kamatom i isplaniranim isplatama. Dajući &kappname; sve informacije o zajmu, "
"&kappname; vam može pomoći da pratite kamate isplate i ostatak duga."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:356
#, no-c-format
msgid "On the Details page you enter the general information about the loan."
msgstr "Na stranici detalja unosite sve detaljne informacije o zajmu."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:360
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"First, select whether you are borrowing or lending money. If you are "
"borrowing money the loan will be listed in Accounts under Liabilities. If "
"you are lending money the loan will be listed under Assets."
msgstr ""
"Prvo odaberite da li posuđujete novac od nekoga ili ga vi posuđujete nekom. "
"Ukoliko vi posuđujete novac od nekog, zajam će biti napravljen kao Liability "
"račun. Ukoliko vi posuđujete novac nekome, zajam će biti napravljen kao "
"Asset račun."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:366
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Next, select the payee or payer of the loan. As always, if the name "
#| "doesn't yet exist in the Payees list, enter it here and &kappname; will "
#| "create it for you."
msgid ""
"Next, select the payee or payer of the loan. As always, if the name doesn't "
"yet exist in the Payees list, enter it here and &kmymoney; will create it "
"for you."
msgstr ""
"Zatim odredite osobu koja daje zajam ili koja je dužna da ga vrati. Kao i "
"uvijek, ukoliko ime još uvijek ne postoji na listi osoba, samo ga unesite i "
"&kappname; će ga napraviti za vas."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:372
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The next three items are for handling Loans on which you've already made "
#| "payments. If you select Yes in the \"Have you made/received any payments "
#| "yet?\" item you can then select whether you want to record all payments "
#| "or just those from the beginning of the current year. If you want to "
#| "record from the beginning of the current year, you are than asked to "
#| "input the current balance."
msgid ""
"The next three items are for handling Loans on which you've already made "
"payments. If you select Yes in the <guilabel>\"Did you make/receive any "
"payments yet?\"</guilabel> dropdown, you can then select whether you want to "
"record all payments or just those from the beginning of the current year. If "
"you want to record from the beginning of the current year, you are than "
"asked to input the balance at the beginning of this year."
msgstr ""
"Sljedeće tri stavke se odnose na zajmove za koje ste već izvršili neke "
"uplate. Ukoliko odaberete \"Da\" u \"Da li ste već načinili neku isplatu ili "
"primili određeni novac?\", možete odabrati da li želite da se sve isplate/"
"uplate bilježe ili samo one s početka godine. Ukoliko želite da bilježite "
"uplate/isplate od početka trenutne godine, bićete upitani da unesete "
"trenutno stanje računa."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:381
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Then, select how often payments will be made and how often interest is "
#| "compounded. Compounding is where the interest is added to the amount owed "
#| "on the loan so that when the interest is next calculated there will be "
#| "more interest paid on the interest. It's common for interest to be "
#| "compounded at the same frequency that payments are made."
msgid ""
"Next, select how often payments will be made and how often interest is "
"compounded. Compounding is where the interest is added to the amount owed on "
"the loan so that when the interest is next calculated there will be more "
"interest paid on the interest. It's common for interest to be compounded at "
"the same frequency that payments are made."
msgstr ""
"Zatim odaberite koliko često će uplate biti izvršene i koliko često će se "
"vrijednost kamate mijenjati. Dolazi do promjene kamate pošto će se prilikom "
"prvog računanja vrijednost duga povećati, pa će se sljedeći put obračunati "
"kamata i na tu dodanu vrijednost. Uobičajeno je da se stopa kredita mijenja "
"simultano sa vršenjem uplate."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:389
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Next, enter the date the first recorded payment will be made."
msgid "Next, enter the date the first payment to be recorded."
msgstr "Zatim unesite datum prve uplate koja će biti zabilježena."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:393
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Finally, enter information about how the interest rate varies. If the "
#| "loan is fixed-rate there is nothing to do. If the rate varies, select "
#| "Variable in \"Type of interest rate\" and then enter the interval between "
#| "interest rate changes and the date the first change of interest rate is "
#| "due: &kappname; will ask you to update the interest rate when that date "
#| "arrives."
msgid ""
"Finally, enter information about how the interest rate varies. If the loan "
"is fixed-rate there is nothing to do. If the rate varies, select Variable in "
"<guilabel>\"Type of interest rate\"</guilabel> and then enter the interval "
"between interest rate changes and the date the first change of interest rate "
"is due: &kmymoney; will ask you to update the interest rate when that date "
"arrives. Click <guibutton>Next</guibutton> to continue."
msgstr ""
"Na kraju unesite informaciju o tome kako će se stopa kamate mijenjati. "
"Ukoliko je zajam fiksiran onda ne morate ništa dodati. Ukoliko će vrijednost "
"kamate varirati, onda odaberite Variable(promjenljivo) u \"Type of interest "
"rate\"(vrsta kamate) i onda unesite interval između kojeg će se stopa kamate "
"mijenjati i datum kada će doći do prve promjene: &kappname; će od vas "
"tražiti da promjenite stopu kamate kada dođe taj datum."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:415
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Payments page is where you enter the payment and interest values for the "
"loan."
msgstr ""
"Payments(plaćanja) stranica predstavlja mjesto na kojem unosite uplate i "
"stopu kamate za zajam."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:420
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"First, select whether the interest rate is calculated when the payment is "
"received or when it becomes due. If you don't know, leave it on the default "
"value."
msgstr ""
"Prvo odaberite da li se kamata računa kada se primi uplata ili kada se "
"dosegne rok. Ukoliko niste sigurni, ostavite na predefinisanu vrijednost."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:426
#, no-c-format
msgid "Next, enter the following values:"
msgstr "Zatim unesite sljedeće vrijednosti:"

#. Tag: term
#: details-accounts.docbook:432
#, no-c-format
msgid "Loan amount"
msgstr "Iznos kredita"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:434
#, no-c-format
msgid "The amount of the loan."
msgstr "Iznos kredita."

#. Tag: term
#: details-accounts.docbook:439
#, no-c-format
msgid "Interest rate"
msgstr "Kamatnu stopu"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:441
#, no-c-format
msgid "The annual percentage interest rate of the loan."
msgstr "Godišnji postotak kamatne stope kredita."

#. Tag: term
#: details-accounts.docbook:446
#, no-c-format
msgid "Term"
msgstr "Rok"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:448
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The length of the loan. Enter a number and select either Months or Years."
msgstr ""
"Dužinu kredita. Unesite broj i odaberite da li on predstavlja mjesece ili "
"godine."

#. Tag: term
#: details-accounts.docbook:456
#, no-c-format
msgid "Payment (principal and interest)"
msgstr "Plaćanje (glavnica i kamata)"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:458
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The amount paid for each loan payment. This is the total of the principal "
#| "and interest paid with each payment."
msgid ""
"The amount of each loan payment. This is the total of the principal and "
"interest paid with each payment."
msgstr ""
"Iznos plaćen za svaku uplatu kredita. ovo je ukupna količina glavnice i "
"kamate isplaćena svakom isplatom."

#. Tag: term
#: details-accounts.docbook:466
#, no-c-format
msgid "Balloon payment"
msgstr "Balonsko plaćanje"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:468
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additional final payment made at the end of the term to pay off the "
"remaining principal of the loan. For a repayment loan this is often zero. "
"For an interest-only loan this will be the same as the loan amount."
msgstr ""
"Dodatna završna isplata na kraju roka kojom se isplaćuje ostatak glavnice "
"kredita. Ukoliko se radi o kreditu vezanom za otplatu ova vrijednost će "
"većinom biti nula. Za kredite vezana za isplatu, ova će vrijednost biti ista "
"kao iznos kredita."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:478
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Finally, use the <guibutton>Calculate</guibutton> button to check the "
#| "values you have entered. You must have entered either all or all but one "
#| "of the values listed above. If you omit two or more values the button is "
#| "disabled because it is not possible to check that the entered values are "
#| "consistent: in that case you will not be able to use the Loan account "
#| "facility in &kappname; and will instead have to use a Liability or Asset "
#| "account to track the loan manually."
msgid ""
"Finally, use the <guibutton>Calculate</guibutton> button to check the values "
"you have entered. You must have entered either all or all but one of the "
"values listed above. If you omit two or more values the button is disabled "
"because it is not possible to check that the entered values are consistent: "
"in that case you will not be able to use the Loan account facility in "
"&kmymoney; and will instead have to use a Liability or Asset account to "
"track the loan manually."
msgstr ""
"Koristite <guibutton>Izračunaj</guibutton> dugme da biste provjerili "
"vrijednosti koje ste unijeli. Morali ste unijeti ili sve ili sve osim jedne "
"vrijednosti. Ukoliko zaboravite unijeti dvije ili više vrijednosti, ovo "
"dugme neće biti omogućeno jer je nemoguća provjera konzistentnosti svih "
"vrijednosti, ukoliko one nisu unesene. U tom slučaju nećete moći koristiti "
"opcije Loan računa u &kappname; i umjesto toga ćete morati koristiti ili "
"Liability ili Asset račun kako biste ručni vodili računa o svom kreditu."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:488
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you omit one value &kappname; will try to calculate it for you. If you "
#| "have entered all values &kappname; will check the values are consistent. "
#| "&kappname; will not adjust entered values other than the \"Balloon payment"
#| "\", which it may adjust slightly to deal with rounding. If the values are "
#| "inconsistent or &kappname; cannot calculate the omitted value &kappname; "
#| "will let you know so that you can correct any errors and repeat the "
#| "calculation."
msgid ""
"If you omit one value, &kmymoney; will try to calculate it for you. If you "
"have entered all values &kmymoney; will check the values are consistent. "
"&kmymoney; will not adjust entered values other than the \"Balloon payment"
"\", which it may adjust slightly to deal with rounding. If the values are "
"inconsistent or &kmymoney; cannot calculate the omitted value, &kmymoney; "
"will let you know so that you can correct any errors and repeat the "
"calculation."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko izostavite samo jednu vrijednost &kappname; će pokušati da izvrši "
"proračun. Ukoliko ste unijeli sve vrijednosti &kappname; će provjeriti da li "
"su one sve konzistentne. &kappname; neće vršiti nikakvu promjenu unesenih "
"vrijednosti osim \"Balon isplate\", koju može neznatno promjeniti kako bi se "
"riješio problem oko zaokruživanja. Ukoliko vrijednosti nisu konzistentne ili "
"&kappname; ne može izračunati izostavljene vrijednosti, &kappname; će vas "
"obavijestiti kako bi mogli izvršiti korekciju eventualnih grešaka i ponoviti "
"proračun."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:497
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Once the values are consistent the <guibutton>Next</guibutton> button is "
#| "enabled and you can advance to the next page."
msgid ""
"Once the values are consistent, the <guibutton>Next</guibutton> button is "
"enabled and you can advance to the next page."
msgstr ""
"Kada vrijednosti budu konzistentne, <guibutton>Sljedeći</guibutton> dugme će "
"biti omogućeno i moći ćete nastaviti na sljedeću stranicu."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:515
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Fees page is where you can enter any fees added to the loan payments."
msgstr ""
"Stranica Fees(naknade) je mjesto na kojem možete unijeti bilo kakve naknade "
"dodane kreditnim isplatama."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:519
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If there are any fees press the <guibutton>Additional Fees</guibutton> "
#| "button. The Transaction Split editor will be displayed for entry of the "
#| "fees. Any lines added here will be included in the payment schedule for "
#| "the loan. When you save the splits the Fees page will display the "
#| "principal and interest payment, the total additional fees and the total "
#| "periodic payment."
msgid ""
"If there are any fees press the <guibutton>Additional Fees</guibutton> "
"button. The Transaction Split editor will be displayed for entry of the "
"fees. Any lines added here will be included in the payment schedule for the "
"loan. When you save the splits the Fees page will display the principal and "
"interest payment, the total additional fees, and the total periodic payment."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko postoje bilo kakve naknade pritisnite <guibutton>Dodatni troškovi</"
"guibutton> dugme. Transaction Split(podjela transakcije) uređivač će se "
"pojaviti kako biste unijeli sve naknade. Sve linije dodane ovdje će biti "
"uključene u raspored isplata za kredit. Kada sačuvate podjelu, Fees stranica "
"će prikazati glavnicu i stopu kamate, ukuupne naknade i ukupnu periodičnu "
"isplatu."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:540
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kappname; will create a <link linkend=\"details.schedules\">scheduled "
#| "transaction</link> for your loan. The Schedule page is where you enter "
#| "the remaining details needed to create the schedule."
msgid ""
"&kmymoney; will create a <link linkend=\"details.schedules\">scheduled "
"transaction</link> for your loan. The Schedule page is where you enter the "
"remaining details needed to create the schedule."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; će napraviti <link linkend=\"details.schedules\">planiranu "
"transakciju</link> za kredit. Schedule(raspored) stranica je mjesto na kojem "
"unosite preostale detalje potrebne za pravljenje rasporeda."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:546
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"First enter the Category to which loan interest will be assigned. Then enter "
"the account from which the loan payment will be made."
msgstr ""
"Prvo unesite Category(kategorija) kojoj kamata kredit pripada. Zatim unesite "
"račun sa kojeg će isplata kredita biti ostvarena."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:551
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The page also displays the first payment date for which the Schedule will be "
"created."
msgstr ""
"Ova stranica će ujedno prikazati i datum prve isplate za koju će raspored "
"biti napravljen."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:569
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Optionally, &kappname; can create a transaction representing what was "
#| "received or paid when the loan was created."
msgid ""
"Optionally, &kmymoney; can create a transaction representing what was "
"received or paid when the loan was created."
msgstr ""
"Opcionalno, &kappname; može napraviti transakciju koja predstavlja sve što "
"je primljeno ili plaćeno kada je kredit napravljen."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:574
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you borrowed or lent cash select the account from which or to which the "
"loan amount was paid."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste posudili nekome ili od nekoga gotovinu, odaberite račun sa kojeg ili "
"na koji je novac uplaćen."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:579
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you borrowed money to purchase a car you can select or create an Asset "
"account to help you track the value of the new car."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko ste posudili novac da kupite automobil možete napraviti Asset račun "
"da pratite vrijednost novog automobila."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:584
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you re-financed an existing Loan check the \"Refinance existing loan\" "
#| "check box, select the Loan account and &kappname; will create a transfer "
#| "transaction paying off the existing loan."
msgid ""
"If you re-financed an existing Loan, check the <guilabel>\"Refinance "
"existing loan\"</guilabel> check box, select the Loan account and &kmymoney; "
"will create a transfer transaction paying off the existing loan."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko ste refinansirali postojeći kredit obilježite \"Refinansiraj "
"postojeći zajam\" prozor, obilježite zajamski račun i &kappname; će "
"napraviti transfer transakciju koja otplaćuje postojeći kredit."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:590
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you don't want to create the payout transaction, check the \"Do not "
#| "create transaction\" check box."
msgid ""
"If you don't want to create the payout transaction, check the <guilabel>\"Do "
"not create payout transaction\"</guilabel> check box."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko ne želite da napravite takvu transakciju, obilježite \"Ne kreiraj "
"transakciju\" kućicu."

#. Tag: title
#: details-accounts.docbook:597
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Parent Account</title>"
msgstr "<title>Nadređeni račun</title>"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: details-accounts.docbook:601
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Parent Account</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Nadređeni račun</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:613
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "This is the penultimate step in creating a new account. A tree of "
#| "accounts is displayed. The tree will be of your Asset or Liability "
#| "accounts, depending on the type of account that is being created."
msgid ""
"This is the penultimate step in creating any new account except a loan. "
"Depending on the type of account that is being created, a tree of your Asset "
"or Liability accounts will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je pretposljednji korak u pravljenju novog računa. Stablo računa će biti "
"prikazano. Stablo će biti sastavljeno od vaših Asset ili Liability računa, u "
"ovisnosti od vrste računa koji se pravi."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:619
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Parent Account page is not currently shown for Loans because they cannot "
"be created as subaccounts. Also, Investment accounts cannot contain other "
"accounts so they are not shown in the tree."
msgstr ""
"Parent Account(\"roditeljski\" račun) stranica nije trenutno prikazana za "
"kredite pošto oni ne mogu biti napravljeni kao podračuni. Također, "
"investicioni računi ne mogu sadržavati bilo koje druge pa ni oni nisu "
"prikazani u stablu."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:625
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the account you wish contain the new account. If you do not select a "
"parent account, the new account will be created at the top level."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite račun za koji želite da sadrži novi račun. Ukoliko ne odaberete "
"\"roditeljski\" račun, novi račun će biti napravljen na najvišem nivou."

#. Tag: title
#: details-accounts.docbook:633
#, no-c-format
msgid "Review and save the account details"
msgstr "Pregled i spašavanje detalja računa"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: details-accounts.docbook:637
#, no-c-format
msgid "Review"
msgstr "Pregled"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:649
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "This is the final step in creating a new account. A summary of the "
#| "information entered is displayed. Review it, and if everything is OK "
#| "press the Finish button. Otherwise, either press the <guibutton>Back</"
#| "guibutton> button to make corrections or the Cancel button to abandon "
#| "creating a new account."
msgid ""
"This is the final step in creating a new account. A summary of the "
"information entered is displayed. Review it, and if everything is OK press "
"<guibutton>Finish</guibutton>. Otherwise, either press <guibutton>Back</"
"guibutton> to make corrections or <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> to abandon "
"creating the new account."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je posljednji korak u pravljenju novog računa. Rezime svih informacija "
"koje ste unijeli će biti prikazan. Pregledajte ga i ako je sve uredu "
"pritisnite Završi dugme. Ako to nije slučaj, ili pritisnite "
"<guibutton>Nazad</guibutton>  dugme kako biste izvršili određene korekcije "
"ili Otkaži dugme kako biste obustavili pravljenje novog računa."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:657
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"NOTE: The Type and Currency cannot at present be changed after the account "
"is created."
msgstr ""
"BILJEŠKA: Type(vrsta) i Currency(valuta) se ne mogu promjeniti nakon što je "
"račun napravljen."

#. Tag: title
#: details-accounts.docbook:665
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opening / viewing accounts"
msgstr "Otvaranje / pregled računa"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:667
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To open an account in the Ledger view you can either click on the link to "
"the account from the Home view, or click on the <guiicon><inlinemediaobject> "
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"ledgers_view.png\"/> </imageobject> </"
"inlinemediaobject>Ledgers</guiicon> icon in the view selector and select the "
"account in the drop down box at the top of the view. Alternatively, in the "
"<guiicon>Account</guiicon> view, either double-click the account entry or "
"right click and select <guimenuitem>Open ledger</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"Za otvaranje računa u Ledger pregledu možete ili kliknuti na link računa iz "
"Home pregleda ili kliknuti na <guiicon><inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"ledgers_view.png\"/> </imageobject> </"
"inlinemediaobject>Ledgers</guiicon> ikonu u izborniku preglednika i "
"odaberite račun iz prozora na vrhu. Alternativno, u <guiicon>Account</"
"guiicon> pregledu možete ili duplim klikom na račun ili desnim klikom i "
"odabirom <guimenuitem>Open ledger</guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: title
#: details-accounts.docbook:679
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editing Account Information"
msgstr "Uređivanje informacija računa"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:681
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To edit a particular account, right-click that account and choose "
"<menuchoice><guimenuitem>Edit account...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or with "
"that account open in the ledger, select <menuchoice><guimenu>Account</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Edit Account...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. A window "
"will pop-up with several tabs, each allowing you to view and change certain "
"information about the account. For more information on any of these details, "
"see the section on <link linkend=\"details.accounts.create\">creating a new "
"account</link>."
msgstr ""
"Da biste uredili određeni račun, desni klik na račun i odaberite "
"<menuchoice><guimenuitem>Edit account...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ili sa "
"tim računom otvorenim u Ledger pregledu, odaberite "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Account</guimenu><guimenuitem>Edit Account...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Novi prozor će se otvoriti sa nekoliko tab-ova, "
"od kojih svaki omogućuje promjenu određenih informacija o računu. Za više "
"informacija o bilo čemu dosad pomenutom, pogledajte sekciju u <link linkend="
"\"details.accounts.create\">pravljenju novog računa</link>."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: details-accounts.docbook:694
#, no-c-format
msgid "Edit an account"
msgstr "Uređivanje računa"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-accounts.docbook:702
#, no-c-format
msgid "Edit account information"
msgstr "Uređivanje informacija računa"

#. Tag: title
#: details-accounts.docbook:708
#, no-c-format
msgid "General"
msgstr "Općenito"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:709
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"View the general information about the account, and change the name, start "
"or opening date, as well as some of the other basic settings of the account."
msgstr ""
"Pregledajte općenite informacije o računu, promjenite ime, početni datum kao "
"i neke druge osnovne postavke računa."

#. Tag: title
#: details-accounts.docbook:716
#, no-c-format
msgid "Institution"
msgstr "Institucija"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:717
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"View and change the associated banking institution and account numbers. You "
"can also create a new institution here."
msgstr ""
"Pregledajte i promjenite odgovarajuću banku i broj računa. Također ovdje "
"možete kreirati novu instituciju."

#. Tag: title
#: details-accounts.docbook:723
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hierarchy"
msgstr "Hijerarhija"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:724
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can change the parent account by clicking on another parent account in "
"this view of the account hierarchy."
msgstr ""
"Možete promjeniti \"roditeljski\" račun klikom na neki drugi \"roditeljski\" "
"račun u ovom pregledu hijerarhije računa."

#. Tag: title
#: details-accounts.docbook:737
#, no-c-format
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "Ograničenja"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:738
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "This tab is only present for asset and liability accounts. If you enter "
#| "amounts in the available fields, &kappname; will warn you when the "
#| "account balance reaches those values."
msgid ""
"This tab is only present for asset and liability accounts. If you enter "
"amounts in the available fields, &kmymoney; will warn you when the account "
"balance reaches those values."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj tab je prisutan samo za Sredstva i Dugovanje račune. Ukoliko unesete "
"vrijednosti u dostupna prazna polja, &kappname; će vas upozoriti kada stanje "
"na računu dosegne te vrijednosti."

#. Tag: title
#: details-accounts.docbook:745
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Tax</title>"
msgstr "<title>Porez</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:746
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can check whether this is a VAT account, and whether to include "
"this account on tax reports."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete provjeriti da li je ovo PDV račun i da li ovaj račun treba "
"uključiti u porezne izvještaje."

#. Tag: title
#: details-accounts.docbook:752
#, no-c-format
msgid "Online Settings"
msgstr "Online postavke"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:753
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This tab is only be present if the account has been mapped to an <link "
"linkend=\"details.impexp.ofxdirectconnect\">online account</link>. It has "
"three subtabs."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj tab je samo prisutan ukoliko je račun mapiran sa <link linkend="
"\"details.impexp.ofxdirectconnect\">online računom</link>. Posjeduje tri "
"podtaba."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:762
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Account Details</emphasis> This shows the status of the online "
"connection, the bank/broker and account number, and allows you to store or "
"change the password for the online account."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Detalji računa</emphasis> ovo prikazuje status online konekcije, "
"banku/brokera i broj računa, i omogućava da spasite ili promjenite šifru "
"online računa."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:770
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<emphasis>OFX Details</emphasis> Here you can adjust certain details "
#| "&kappname; uses when it establishes an OFX connection with the "
#| "institution. This should only be necessary if you get certain errors when "
#| "you first set up the online account, or perhaps if your institution "
#| "changes its OFX server software."
msgid ""
"<emphasis>OFX Details</emphasis> Here you can adjust certain details "
"&kmymoney; uses when it establishes an OFX connection with the institution. "
"This should only be necessary if you get certain errors when you first set "
"up the online account, or perhaps if your institution changes its OFX server "
"software."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>OFX Details</emphasis> Ovdje možete urediti određene detalje koje "
"&kappname; koristi kada uspostavi OFX konekciju sa institucijom. ovo bi "
"trebalo biti nužno samo ako dođe do određenih problema prilikom početnog "
"postavljanja online računa ili ukoliko vaša institucija promjeni software "
"svog OFX servera."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:780
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<emphasis>Import Details</emphasis> Here you can tell &kappname; what to "
#| "use as the start date for the import. In addition, starting with version "
#| "4.6, you can choose whether the payee's name is based on the PAYEEID, "
#| "NAME, or MEMO field of the imported transaction."
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Import Details</emphasis> Here you can tell &kmymoney; what to use "
"as the start date for the import. In addition, starting with version 4.6, "
"you can choose whether the payee's name is based on the PAYEEID, NAME, or "
"MEMO field of the imported transaction."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Detalji uvoza</emphasis> Ovdje možete reći &kappname; šta da "
"koristi kao početni datum unosa. Također, počevši od verzije 4.6, možete "
"odabrati da li će se ime primaoca bazirati na PAYEEID, NAME, ili MEMO polju "
"unesene transakcije."

#. Tag: title
#: details-accounts.docbook:791
#, no-c-format
msgid "Deleting accounts"
msgstr "Brisanje računa"

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:793
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To delete an account, first remove all the transactions from that account in "
"the ledger. Next, find the account in the accounts view and after right "
"clicking on the entry to show the popup menu select <guimenuitem>Delete "
"account...</guimenuitem> from the popup menu."
msgstr ""
"Da biste obrisali račun, prvo uklonite sve transakcije tog računa u LEdger "
"pregledu. Zatim nađite račun koji želite obrisati u pregledu računa i nakon "
"desnog klika na račun, na popup meniju odaberite <guimenuitem>Delete "
"account...</guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:800
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you are unable to delete an account which looks like it has no "
#| "transactions in it, check your filter. See <menuchoice> "
#| "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure &kappname;</"
#| "guimenuitem> <guimenuitem>General</guimenuitem> <guimenuitem>Filter</"
#| "guimenuitem> </menuchoice>. Clear all filters. Set the start date to "
#| "1.1.1900 or so."
msgid ""
"If you are unable to delete an account which looks like it has no "
"transactions in it, check your filter. See <menuchoice> <guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure &kmymoney;</guimenuitem> "
"<guimenuitem>General</guimenuitem> <guimenuitem>Filter</guimenuitem> </"
"menuchoice>. Clear all filters. Set the start date to 1.1.1900 or so."
msgstr ""
"Ukolilo niste u mogućnosti da obrišete račun koji izgleda kao da ne sadrži "
"ikakve transakcije u sebi, provjerite svoj filter. Pogledajte <menuchoice> "
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure &kappname;</guimenuitem> "
"<guimenuitem>General</guimenuitem> <guimenuitem>Filter</guimenuitem> </"
"menuchoice>. Očistite sve filtere. Postavite početni datum na 1.1.1900 ili "
"nešto slično."

#. Tag: para
#: details-accounts.docbook:808
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "There may be transactions in your ledger that are not shown, for example, "
#| "if you have inadvertently typed in the wrong year when making an entry so "
#| "that an entry remains outside the opening date of &kappname;. This "
#| "appears beneath the ledger page as remaining funds."
msgid ""
"There may be transactions in your ledger that are not shown, for example, if "
"you have inadvertently typed in the wrong year when making an entry so that "
"an entry remains outside the opening date of &kmymoney;. This appears "
"beneath the ledger page as remaining funds."
msgstr ""
"Možda postoje transakcije u LEdger pregledu koje nisu prikazane, npr. "
"ukoliko ste slučajno unijeli pogrešnu godinu prilikom unosa tako da se "
"nalazi izvan datuma otvaranja &kappname;. Te transakcije će se pojaviti "
"ispod Ledger stranice kao preostala sredstva."

#~ msgid "2011-07-21"
#~ msgstr "2011-07-21"

#~ msgid "<releaseinfo>4.6</releaseinfo>"
#~ msgstr "<releaseinfo>4.6</releaseinfo>"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "There are two ways to view the accounts: List or Icon view, which may be "
#~ "selected by clicking on the appropriate tab at the top of the view."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Postoje dva načina na koja možete pregledati račun: List ili Icon "
#~ "pregled, koje možete odabrati klikom na odgovarajući tab na vrhu prozora."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "In the List view, the accounts are grouped under four headings: Asset, "
#~ "Liability, Income, and Expense. List view shows the name and balance or "
#~ "value of each account. Income and Expense list the categories that each "
#~ "transaction is filed under, and provide similar functionality to the "
#~ "Categories screen. The options and features involving Income and Expense "
#~ "accounts are described in detail in the <link linkend=\"details.categories"
#~ "\">Categories</link> chapter. The rest of this chapter will focus on "
#~ "Asset and Liability account functionality."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "U List pregledu, računi su grupisani u 4 naslova: Sredstvo, Obaveze, "
#~ "Prihodi i Troškovi. List pregled prikazuje ime i stanje svakog od računa. "
#~ "Prihodi i Troškovi prikazuju kategorije svih datoteka u kojim se nalaze "
#~ "transakcije i pružaju sličnu funkcionalnost Kategorije pregleda. Sve "
#~ "opcije i odlike Prihoda i Troškova računa su detaljno opisane u <link "
#~ "linkend=\"details.categories\">Categorije</link> poglavlju. Ostatak ovog "
#~ "poglavlja će biti fokusiran na funkcionalnost Sredstva i Obaveze  računa."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "In the Icon view, the Asset and Liability accounts are shown with icons "
#~ "indicating the account type. &kappname; initially places the icons "
#~ "alphabetically, but you can move the icons to any position you want, just "
#~ "by dragging the icon with the mouse. Note, however, that just moving an "
#~ "icon does not currently trigger &kappname; to think that any data has "
#~ "been changed. This means that you need to make some other change, such as "
#~ "editing an account or a transaction and saying OK (even without actually "
#~ "changing any data) so &kappname; allows you to save the file. The saved "
#~ "file will include the new icon positions."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "U Ikona pregledu, Sredstva i Obaveze računi su prikazani kao ikone koje "
#~ "indiciraju na tip računa. &kappname; ikone inicijalno postavlja po "
#~ "abecednom redu, ali ih vi možete premještati na bilo koju poziciju, "
#~ "jednostavno klikom i povlačenjem ikone pomoću miša. Primijetite da samo "
#~ "pomjeranje ikone ne podstiče &kappname; da misli da je došlo do bilo "
#~ "kakve promjene datoteka. To znači da morate napraviti neke druge "
#~ "promjene, kao što su uređivanje računa ili transakcije (iako niste "
#~ "promijenili nikakve podatke) kako bi vam &kappname; omogućio da spasite "
#~ "svoju datoteku. Spašena datoteka će odsada imati onaj položaj datoteka "
#~ "pri kojem je bila sačuvana."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Alternatively, to create an account using the accounts view, click on the "
#~ "Accounts icon in the view selector and then right click on the Asset tree "
#~ "icon in the right hand view and select <guimenuitem>New account...</"
#~ "guimenuitem> from the popup menu. The Asset tree holds all of your "
#~ "accounts that are an asset. Assets, and all the other account types, are "
#~ "discussed in more detail later in this manual."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Alternativno, da biste napravili račun koristeći pregled računa, kliknite "
#~ "na Računi ikonu u selektoru pregleda i onda desnim klikom na Stablo "
#~ "sredstava ikonu se otvara iskočni meni na kojem imate opciju "
#~ "<guimenuitem>Novi račun...</guimenuitem>. Stablo sredstava sadržava sve "
#~ "vaše račune koji pripadaju kategoriji Sredstva. Takvi računi kao i ostale "
#~ "kategorije su opisani detaljnije kasnije u ovom priručniku."

#~ msgid "This page is used to configure the type of account."
#~ msgstr "Ova stranica se koristi za određivanje vrste računa."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Next, select the type of account from one of the types available from the "
#~ "dropdown list:"
#~ msgstr "Zatim izaberite jednu od ponuđenih vrsta računa iz opadajuće liste:"

